    "body": "When the waiver is granted before legal review is recorded, the client contract notice period waiver case pauses until the contract register shows a corrected value and a named releaser. A client contract notice period waiver exception that touches the client confirmation record requires a new check of the contract register before release. A client contract notice period waiver exception without a releaser is treated as open, even if the workaround already ran.\n\nThe client contract notice period waiver queue marks a paused case with the reason it stopped and the person who can release it. The client contract notice period waiver exception log records the client impact, the stop time, and the restart time. A repeated client contract notice period waiver exception becomes a reason code rather than a story retold in each thread. The client contract notice period waiver queue marks the exception with its age so a second occurrence is easy to find."
