    "body": "The client contract notice period waiver close note ties the signed waiver at the approved notice date to the original request and the final evidence reference. A client contract notice period waiver close that changes waiver request keeps the prior value available for comparison. A client contract notice period waiver case that moved between owners keeps both owner periods visible at close. The client contract notice period waiver close note records the reason, the approver, and the evidence reference together.\n\nFor client contract notice period waiver, the population is every notice period waiver in the frozen window, counted once per client and period. If client contract notice period waiver hands work to another team, the case stays open until that team acknowledges receipt. The client contract notice period waiver close note names the next review date even when no further action is required. The final client contract notice period waiver check compares the client confirmation with the surviving value in the contract register; a status label is not a close."
